{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Create a Premium Lock quote"},"description":"Use when the person wants a Premium Lock quote. Creates a Premium Lock quote from a home's address or a car's VIN and the person's current insurance policy. The person's email goes in insured.email. Returns a quote_id; call get_quote until its status is complete.\n\nPremium Lock is not insurance or a financial derivative. Prices are set by Eventual's own pricing, not by the assistant. The person pays on eventualclimate.com; the assistant never charges anyone. Send only the fields a tool lists; never send conversation content or anything else about the person.\n\nGathering order: first ask for the consumer's email. Then ask whether they have their home or auto declarations page to share. If they give a link to it, send it to read_declarations_page as document_url; if they attach the file, call request_document_upload, give them the upload_url, and once they say it's uploaded call read_declarations_page with the upload_id. Pass the fields it returns to create_quote. If they have no declarations page, ask the consumer for the fields create_quote needs.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"auto":{"description":"The auto insurance policy, for an auto or bundle quote. Money in dollars. The policy start date is when the policy term the Premium Lock starts on begins, and is held to the same 90-day window as a home renewal.","properties":{"admitted_lines_confirmed":{"default":false,"description":"True when this policy is written on admitted lines. Required for an excess-and-surplus carrier: without it the quote is refused with 422 `product_line_ineligible`. A last-resort carrier is refused either way.","title":"Admitted Lines Confirmed","type":"boolean"},"business_use_confirmed":{"default":false,"description":"The consumer confirms their policy covers each car's business use. Required when any car's `usage` is `business`.","title":"Business Use C